    <string name="settings_anime_preset" tools:ignore="MissingTranslation">Apply anime DVD preset</string>
    <string name="settings_anime_preset_summary" tools:ignore="MissingTranslation">PAL anime/cartoon DVD to a tiny AV1 file: field matching to 25p, border crop, NL-means, AV1 speed 2 in 10 bit, two-pass 150 kbit/s, 480p, Opus 32 kbit/s stereo, MKV</string>
    <string name="settings_anime_preset_confirm" tools:ignore="MissingTranslation">Sets: deinterlace with field matching (25p), automatic border crop, NL-means denoise, AV1 software at speed 2 in 10 bit, two-pass at 150 kbit/s, max. 480p, Opus 32 kbit/s stereo, MKV output, audio and subtitle tracks to tick when sharing, keep converting with the screen off, save a copy to Movies.\n\nCustom video parameters are cleared. The CRF stays as it is.\n\n“Undo anime preset” brings back the settings from before.</string>
    <string name="settings_anime_preset_apply" tools:ignore="MissingTranslation">Apply</string>
